      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "GeminiVideoOmni",
        "studio_provider": "Google",
        "studio_role": "process"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Omni Flash",
        "The uploaded video is COMPLETELY LOCKED.\n\nDO NOT modify, regenerate, reinterpret, replace, redraw, restyle, crop, stabilize, enhance, or alter any part of the original footage.\n\nKeep absolutely identical:\n• dancer\n• body proportions\n• clothing\n• sunglasses\n• background\n• building\n• floor\n• perspective\n• framing\n• camera\n• timing\n• choreography\n• motion\n• lighting\n• shadows\n• colors\n• image quality\n\nThe output must preserve the original video pixel-for-pixel.\n\nONLY generate animated 2D motion graphics as a transparent overlay layer that appears above the existing footage.\n\nThe graphics must never cover the dancer's body completely and must naturally follow the movement.\n\nEvery graphic element should appear only during the corresponding dance motion and disappear immediately afterward.\n\nStyle:\nModern hip-hop motion graphics, Spider-Verse inspired, comic-book animation, hand-drawn motion design, bold graphic shapes, energetic editorial animation.\n\nUse only flat 2D vector-style graphics.\n\nInclude:\n\n• Brush stroke trails following arm swings\n• Speed lines following fast movements\n• Comic impact bursts\n• Ink splash accents\n• Dynamic motion trails\n• Halftone dot textures\n• Circular impact rings\n• Graphic arrows\n• Scribble lines\n• Lightning accents\n• Floating geometric shapes\n• Graphic particles\n• Small stars\n• Cross marks\n• X symbols\n• Triangle bursts\n• Circular frames\n• Liquid graphic lines\n• Graphic shockwaves under footsteps\n• Dust puff graphics\n• Animated paint streaks\n\nAnimation behavior:\n\nHand movement →\nBrush strokes, speed lines, comic trails.\n\nFoot movement →\nShockwave circles, dust puffs, impact splashes.\n\nBody pop →\nComic burst, halftone pulse, expanding rings.\n\nSpin →\nLarge rotating graphic circle with floating geometric particles.\n\nFinal pose →\nLarge comic explosion graphic behind the dancer that quickly dissolves into scattered paper fragments.\n\nGraphics should use only:\n\n